{"seq":3,"slug":"numerical-precision","title":"数值精度与陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/fortran-scientific/arrays-numerics/numerical-precision","wordCount":1117,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"数值精度与陷阱\">数值精度与陷阱</h1><p>一段在气候模拟里跑了十年的代码，某天换了编译器后结果在小数点后第八位开始分叉——这不是 bug，是浮点数的本性。科学计算的全部尊严都建立在「结果可信」之上，而可信的前提是理解浮点数会怎样、在哪里、以多大幅度背叛你。这一篇把 <a href=\"../foundations/data-types-precision\">数据类型与精度</a> 里建立的 KIND 系统拉到实战，直面那些会悄悄毁掉计算的精度陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>所有精度陷阱的根源是一句话：浮点数不是实数。它是有限位二进制对实数的近似，于是产生四个后果——舍入误差、不可精确表示的十进制小数、灾难性抵消、以及误差在长计算链中的累积。理解这四者，就能预判 90% 的数值事故。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[浮点数 = 实数的有限近似] --&gt; B[舍入误差&lt;br/&gt;每次运算引入]&#10;  A --&gt; C[十进制不可精确表示&lt;br/&gt;0.1 在二进制无限循环]&#10;  A --&gt; D[灾难性抵消&lt;br/&gt;两个接近的数相减]&#10;  A --&gt; E[误差累积&lt;br/&gt;长求和/迭代放大]&#10;  B --&gt; F[绝不用 == 比较浮点]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  D --&gt; G[重写公式避免相减]&#10;  E --&gt; H[用补偿求和/更高精度]\">flowchart TD\n  A[浮点数 = 实数的有限近似] --&gt; B[舍入误差&lt;br/&gt;每次运算引入]\n  A --&gt; C[十进制不可精确表示&lt;br/&gt;0.1 在二进制无限循环]\n  A --&gt; D[灾难性抵消&lt;br/&gt;两个接近的数相减]\n  A --&gt; E[误差累积&lt;br/&gt;长求和/迭代放大]\n  B --&gt; F[绝不用 == 比较浮点]\n  C --&gt; F\n  D --&gt; G[重写公式避免相减]\n  E --&gt; H[用补偿求和/更高精度]</pre><p>下表给出几个关键的浮点事实和对应的 KIND，帮助建立量感。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>KIND 来源</th>\n<th>机器 epsilon (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>)</th>\n<th>可靠有效位数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单精度</td>\n<td><code>selected_real_kind(6)</code></td>\n<td>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.2\\times10^{-7}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>~7 位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双精度</td>\n<td><code>selected_real_kind(15)</code></td>\n<td>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.2\\times10^{-16}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>~16 位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四精度</td>\n<td><code>selected_real_kind(33)</code></td>\n<td>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.9</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.9\\times10^{-34}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">34</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>~34 位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>机器 epsilon 是「1.0 与下一个可表示浮点数之间的间隔」，可用内置函数 <code>epsilon(1.0_dp)</code> 取得，是衡量精度的基准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"永远不要用-比较浮点数\">永远不要用 == 比较浮点数</h2><p>这是头号铁律。由于舍入，理论上相等的两个浮点数在机器里往往差一点点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"fortran\" data-code=\"real(dp) :: x&#10;x = 0.1_dp + 0.2_dp&#10;if (x == 0.3_dp) print *, &quot;相等&quot;     ! 几乎不会打印!&#10;! 正确做法: 比较差的绝对值是否在容差内&#10;if (abs(x - 0.3_dp) &lt; 1.0e-12_dp) print *, &quot;近似相等&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>real(dp) :: x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x = 0.1_dp + 0.2_dp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (x == 0.3_dp) print *, \"相等\"     ! 几乎不会打印!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>! 正确做法: 比较差的绝对值是否在容差内</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (abs(x - 0.3_dp) &#x3C; 1.0e-12_dp) print *, \"近似相等\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>0.1</code>、<code>0.2</code>、<code>0.3</code> 在二进制里都是无限循环小数，截断后 <code>0.1+0.2</code> 不精确等于 <code>0.3</code>。正确做法是设一个容差(tolerance),比较两数之差是否足够小。容差的选取要结合机器 epsilon 和数值的量级——比较大数时常用相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|a-b| / |a| &lt; \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">∣/∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>。这里 <code>0.1_dp</code> 的后缀是必须的，原因回看 <a href=\"../foundations/data-types-precision\">数据类型与精度</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"灾难性抵消-最隐蔽的精度杀手\">灾难性抵消：最隐蔽的精度杀手</h2><p>当两个非常接近的数相减时，结果的有效位数会急剧损失——这叫灾难性抵消。经典案例是用求根公式解二次方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ax^2+bx+c=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"fortran\" data-code=\"! 危险: 当 b 很大、4ac 很小时, -b + sqrt(b^2-4ac) 是两个接近数相减&#10;x1 = (-b + sqrt(b*b - 4.0_dp*a*c)) / (2.0_dp*a)&#10;! 稳健: 先算数值稳定的那个根, 再用 x1*x2 = c/a 反推&#10;q = -0.5_dp * (b + sign(sqrt(b*b - 4.0_dp*a*c), b))&#10;x1 = q / a&#10;x2 = c / q\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>! 危险: 当 b 很大、4ac 很小时, -b + sqrt(b^2-4ac) 是两个接近数相减</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x1 = (-b + sqrt(b*b - 4.0_dp*a*c)) / (2.0_dp*a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>! 稳健: 先算数值稳定的那个根, 再用 x1*x2 = c/a 反推</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>q = -0.5_dp * (b + sign(sqrt(b*b - 4.0_dp*a*c), b))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x1 = q / a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x2 = c / q</span></span></code></pre></div><p>抵消的可怕之处在于它不报错，只是悄悄让你的有效位数从 16 位掉到 3 位。识别它需要分析公式:凡是「两个量级相近的数相减」的地方都要警惕，往往能通过代数变形(如这里用韦达定理换公式)绕开。这类陷阱在 <a href=\"../practice/tooling-pitfalls\">工具链与陷阱</a> 还会从工程角度再提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"求和的误差累积与补偿求和\">求和的误差累积与补偿求和</h2><p>把一百万个浮点数累加，朴素的逐个相加会累积可观的舍入误差，尤其当数值量级差异大时——小数加到大累加器上可能被完全「吃掉」。内置的 <code>sum</code> 通常已比朴素循环好，但对极端情况，Kahan 补偿求和能显著提高精度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"fortran\" data-code=\"function kahan_sum(a) result(s)&#10;  real(dp), intent(in) :: a(:)&#10;  real(dp) :: s, c, y, t&#10;  integer :: i&#10;  s = 0.0_dp;  c = 0.0_dp           ! c 是补偿项, 追踪丢失的低位&#10;  do i = 1, size(a)&#10;    y = a(i) - c&#10;    t = s + y&#10;    c = (t - s) - y                 ! 找回这一步丢掉的低位&#10;    s = t&#10;  end do&#10;end function kahan_sum\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function kahan_sum(a) result(s)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  real(dp), intent(in) :: a(:)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  real(dp) :: s, c, y, t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  integer :: i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  s = 0.0_dp;  c = 0.0_dp           ! c 是补偿项, 追踪丢失的低位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  do i = 1, size(a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    y = a(i) - c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    t = s + y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c = (t - s) - y                 ! 找回这一步丢掉的低位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    s = t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end function kahan_sum</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Kahan 算法用一个补偿变量 <code>c</code> 把每步丢失的低位「找回来」加到下一步，能把误差从随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 增长压到几乎常数。这说明一个深刻的点:数学上等价的算法在浮点下精度天差地别。前面 <a href=\"intrinsic-functions\">内置函数</a> 里的 <code>sum</code> 在多数场景够用,但当你做高精度长链求和时,要知道有这一手。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ieee-模块-驯服特殊值与异常\">IEEE 模块：驯服特殊值与异常</h2><p>Fortran 2003 引入了 <code>ieee_arithmetic</code> 模块，让你能规范地处理无穷、NaN 和浮点异常,而不必依赖编译器的非标准行为。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"fortran\" data-code=\"use, intrinsic :: ieee_arithmetic&#10;real(dp) :: x&#10;x = 0.0_dp / 0.0_dp&#10;if (ieee_is_nan(x)) print *, &quot;x 是 NaN&quot;&#10;if (.not. ieee_is_finite(x)) print *, &quot;x 不是有限值&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use, intrinsic :: ieee_arithmetic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>real(dp) :: x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x = 0.0_dp / 0.0_dp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (ieee_is_nan(x)) print *, \"x 是 NaN\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (.not. ieee_is_finite(x)) print *, \"x 不是有限值\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>NaN(非数)有个反直觉性质:它和任何数比较都返回假,包括和自己比——这恰好可以用 <code>x /= x</code> 来检测,但用 <code>ieee_is_nan</code> 更清晰。养成在关键计算后检查 <code>ieee_is_finite</code> 的习惯,能在 NaN 污染整个数组前及早发现。处理这些特殊值时若要和 C 代码交互,数据表示的一致性见 <a href=\"../practice/interop-c\">与 C 互操作</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一切精度陷阱的根源:浮点数是实数的有限二进制近似,会舍入、会有不可表示的小数。</li>\n<li>头号铁律:永远不用 <code>==</code> 比较浮点,改用容差 <code>abs(a-b) &lt; tol</code>,大数用相对误差。</li>\n<li>灾难性抵消(两个接近数相减)会悄悄损失有效位,常可通过代数变形规避。</li>\n<li>长链求和会累积误差,<code>sum</code> 比朴素循环好,极端场景用 Kahan 补偿求和。</li>\n<li>数学等价的算法在浮点下精度可能天差地别,要按数值稳定性而非简洁性选公式。</li>\n<li>用 <code>ieee_arithmetic</code> 模块规范处理 NaN/无穷,关键步骤后检查 <code>ieee_is_finite</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数值精度与陷阱","id":"数值精度与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"永远不要用 == 比较浮点数","id":"永远不要用-比较浮点数"},{"level":2,"text":"灾难性抵消：最隐蔽的精度杀手","id":"灾难性抵消-最隐蔽的精度杀手"},{"level":2,"text":"求和的误差累积与补偿求和","id":"求和的误差累积与补偿求和"},{"level":2,"text":"IEEE 模块：驯服特殊值与异常","id":"ieee-模块-驯服特殊值与异常"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内置函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/fortran-scientific/arrays-numerics/intrinsic-functions"},"next":{"title":"模块与接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/fortran-scientific/modern/modules-interfaces"}}